(in-ns 'go.arbace.py) ^{:go/comments [[3 1 "// Coroutines and async generators (PY5d): CPython's coroutine objects, their __await__ wrapper, the"] [4 1 "// async generators' asend and athrow awaitables (Objects/genobject.c), the operations of await and"] [5 1 "// async for (GET_AWAITABLE, GET_AITER, GET_ANEXT, END_ASYNC_FOR), and RunCoroutine, a driver without"] [6 1 "// an event loop (asyncio is PY5e's and later)."] [17 1 "// coroWrapper is a coroutine's __await__() (CPython's coroutine_wrapper): an iterator sending into it."] [22 1 "// awaitable states (CPython's AWAITABLE_STATE_*)"] [29 1 "// asyncGenASend is an async generator's __anext__() or asend(v) (PyAsyncGenASend)."] [34 15 "// in pendingAgen, tracked at the flush when still not awaited"] [39 1 "// asyncGenAThrow is an async generator's athrow(...) or aclose() (PyAsyncGenAThrow; args nil: aclose)."] [44 15 "// in pendingAgen, tracked at the flush when still not awaited"] [49 1 "// agUnwrap is an async generator's step seen by its awaitable (async_gen_unwrap_value): its end a"] [50 1 "// StopAsyncIteration, a value it yields the awaitable's StopIteration, a value its awaits yield passed"] [51 1 "// on to the event loop."] [70 1 "// send is the asend awaitable's send (async_gen_asend_send)."] [94 1 "// throw is the asend awaitable's throw (async_gen_asend_throw)."] [116 1 "// agCloseEnd is the end of async_gen_asend_close and async_gen_athrow_close: their throw's outcome."] [127 1 "// close is async_gen_asend_close."] [137 1 "// runningError is the awaitable's refusal while its generator runs."] [146 1 "// send is the athrow awaitable's send (async_gen_athrow_send)."] [172 4 "// aclose() mode: the generator not closed when GeneratorExit is thrown"] [210 1 "// yieldClose is async_gen_athrow_send's label: a value yielded in aclose() mode."] [217 1 "// checkError is async_gen_athrow_send's label: the step's error, aclose's StopAsyncIteration or GeneratorExit its"] [218 1 "// awaitable's end."] [231 1 "// throw is the athrow awaitable's throw (async_gen_athrow_throw)."] [252 2 "// aclose() mode"] [270 1 "// close is async_gen_athrow_close."] [278 1 "// pendingAgen are the awaitables made by __anext__(), asend(), athrow() and aclose() (pendingGens's rule): one still"] [279 1 "// not awaited at the flush is tracked, for its \"was never awaited\" at its death (async_gen_asend_finalize,"] [280 1 "// async_gen_athrow_finalize). async for's own asend is awaited at once and is not listed."] [308 1 "// finalizeAgen is async_gen_asend_finalize and async_gen_athrow_finalize (_PyErr_WarnUnawaitedAgenMethod)."] [336 1 "// GetAwaitable is an await's iterator (_PyCoro_GetAwaitableIter): a coroutine itself, else its"] [337 1 "// type's __await__() result, an iterator that is not a coroutine. what names the operand in the"] [338 1 "// error (\"\" the plain await's)."] [341 2 "// a coroutine, or a generator types.coroutine marked (CO_ITERABLE_COROUTINE: gen_is_coroutine)"] [348 21 "// Py_am_await of _asyncio's types"] [374 1 "// RunCoroutine runs a coroutine (or any awaitable) to its end without an event loop: sends None into"] [375 1 "// it until it returns; a value it yields other than None (a future an event loop would wait on) is a"] [376 1 "// RuntimeError. The value it returns; PY5e's asyncio.run can stand on it for programs that await only"] [377 1 "// coroutines and asyncio.sleep(0)."] [398 2 "// GET_AWAITABLE's oparg: 1 the async with's __aenter__, 2 its __aexit__ (their error's words)"] [414 1 "// opGetAiter is get-aiter: the type's __aiter__(), which must have __anext__."] [436 1 "// opGetAnext is get-anext: the awaitable of the next item, the async iterator kept."] [441 48 "// async_gen_anext"] [460 3 "// _PyEval_GetANext: _PyErr_FormatFromCause, the awaitable's error its cause and context"] [472 1 "// opEndAsyncFor is end-async-for ([aiter exc] in the loop's handler): StopAsyncIteration ends the"] [473 1 "// loop, anything else is re-raised."] [483 2 "// a re-raise: the frame's traceback entry made again by the loop at this instruction (as reraise)"] [500 2 "// coroutine"] [515 2 "// coroutine_wrapper"] [540 2 "// async_generator"] [585 2 "// the awaitables of asend and athrow"] [621 1 "// asyncGenInitHooks is async_gen_init_hooks: on an async generator's first use, sys's firstiter hook called with it"] [622 1 "// (PY6h's REQUEST, queue 200: asyncio's loop tracks its async generators so)"] [628 2 "// the finalizer hook kept, handed the generator at its death (async_gen_init_hooks, _PyGen_Finalize; queue 218)"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[63 34] [175 41] [199 40] [253 39] [331 48] [342 28] [365 28] [440 28] [441 33] [461 28] [505 25] [525 66] [534 67] [547 46] [553 65] [556 46] [569 147] [573 46] [579 46] [589 34] [601 58] [607 34] [613 34] [629 45]]} (go/file "coro.go" :imports [])

